   "heading": "Ups and downs notation",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "56edo can be notated using ups and downs . Trup is equivalent to quudsharp, trudsharp is equivalent to quup, etc.\nAlternatively, sharps and flats with arrows borrowed from Helmholtz–Ellis notation can be used:"
